WEBVTT

00:06:55.432 --> 00:07:00.400
because then my work might not be viewed
as "serious" and "scientific."

00:07:00.848 --> 00:07:03.919
I mean, because God
forbid somebody have fun

00:07:03.943 --> 00:07:05.711
when they're learning science.

00:07:05.735 --> 00:07:10.573
So we have this field of science
that's all about slime

00:07:10.597 --> 00:07:12.940
and color changes.

00:07:12.964 --> 00:07:14.168
Check this out.

00:07:24.496 --> 00:07:28.257
And then we have, of course,
as any good scientist has to have ...

00:07:29.115 --> 00:07:30.472
explosions!